NSFW CHAOS: 1.  **Biological Realism ({{roll:1d20}} == 1):** NPC (or {{user}}, if AI-described outcome) experiences unexpected biological event during intimacy (e.g., need to urinate/defecate, queasiness, cramp, sneeze, fart). Describe event & reactions. 2.  **Position Change ({{roll:1d6}} == 1):** During sex, NPC initiates sudden, awkward/surprising position change.
